       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    SADDPITM.
       AUTHOR.        KURT MOVSESIAN/JIM COFFMAN (MAINTAINER).
      ***************************************************************
      *                                                             *
      *   S A D D P I T M                                           *
      *                                                             *
      *   THIS SUB PROGRAM ADDS ITEMS TO A PURCHASE ORDER           *
      *                                                             *
      ***************************************************************
      *C   AUG. 94   JE COFFMAN  REQ #6527
      *C   ADDED CALL TO SCHATREF IF THE USER OPTION SWITCH IS
      *C   SET REQUIRING THAT CHAT NUMBERS BE INCLUDED ON CSIS
      *C   DOCUMENTS CONTAINING CORPORATE CODED ITEMS.
      *C
      *C   FEB. 95    CA ZUBEK   **NOTE**
      *C   COPIED THE LOGIC WHICH ADDS THE TAX AMOUNT TO THE PO
      *C   BUDGETED AMOUNT FROM THIS PROGRAM TO "SRELEASE."  IF THE
      *C   LOGIC IS CHANGED IN THIS PROGRAM, YOU MAY HAVE TO MAKE
      *C   THE SAME CHANGE IN THE PROGRAM "SRELEASE," SINCE IT
      *C   CONTAINS THE SAME LOGIC.
      *C   ** NOTE:  THIS TAX LOGIC WAS REMOVED FROM THIS PROGRAM
      *C   AND REPLACED WITH A CALL TO PROGRAM "SCALCBGT" TO
      *C   CALCULATE THE BUDGET AMOUNT.
      *C
      *C   04/29/96  CA YODER        REQ #96-023
      *C     ADDED TWO CHECKS AT THE REQUEST OF JIM FISHEL IN UNC TO
      *C     NOT ALLOW AN INVOICELESS PO TO BE CREATED IF THE PO IS
      *C     A MEMO Z-BILL OR A NON-RECEIVABLE PO.
      *C
      *C   07/18/96  CA YODER
      *C     MODIFIED FOR CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.
      *C
      *C   10/31/96  JEFF BUNGO
      *C     ADD RECEIVING SLIP STANDARD INSTRUCTIONS.
      *C
      *C   11/20/96  JEFF BUNGO
      *C     ALLOW THE FLAGING OF THIS ITEM TO BE QS9000 TRACKING.
      *C     IF QS9000 TRACKING THEN DISPLAY THE TRACKING SCREEN.
      *C
      *C   12/16/96  CA YODER    REQ #96-040
      *C     THIS REQUEST WAS TO ADD LOGIC TO ALLOW THE USER TO
      *C     MODIFY COMPANY AND PRIME FIELDS.  HOWEVER, LOGIC WAS
      *C     ALREADY IN PLACE FOR THIS BY TURNING ON A SWITCH IN
      *C     PLANT STARTUP.  THE ONLY PROBLEM, THOUGH, WAS THAT
      *C     CLASS WAS BEING VALIDATED IN MVALIDPLTDATA INSTEAD OF
      *C     MCLASS.  MODIFIED THE EDIT CHECK TO USE MCLASS INSTEAD.
      *C
      *C   05/14/97  CA YODER
      *C     ADDED LOGIC TO ACCOUNT FOR FRANCHISE VENDORS/ITEMS.
      *C       1.  ITEMS ON FRANCHISE VENDOR POS CANNOT BE BOTH DIRECT
      *C           DELIVERY AND STOREROOM ITEMS.  THE FIRST ITEM SETS
      *C           THE STANDARD FOR THE REST OF THE ITEMS.
      *C       2.  IF THE ITEMS ARE STOREROOM ITEMS AND THE VENDOR IS A
      *C           FRANCHISE VENDOR, THE PO IS MARKED AS NON-PAYABLE.
      *C
      *C   07/21/97  CA YODER
      *C     ADDED A CHECK FOR NON-NUMERIC DATA IN THE
      *C     VEN-DISCOUNT-PERCENT FIELD.
      *C
      *C   13FEB1998 WL MCINTYRE  REQ# 98-002
      *C     ADD LOGIC TO CHECK FOR TAX CODE ON DREQITM, AND IF
      *C     ENTERED, USE IT AS DEFAULT FOR TAX CODE ON PO ITEM.
      *C
      *C   03/19/1998  CA YODER
      *C     MODIFIED LOGIC FOR FRANCHISED ITEMS.
      *C       - ALL ITEMS ON A PO MUST BE EITHER ALL CONSIGNED OR ALL
      *C             NON-CONSIGNED.
      *C       - IF ALL ITEMS ARE CONSIGNED, THEN IT IS NON-PAYABLE.
      *C       - IF A PO IS NON-PAYABLE, THEN ALL ITEMS MUST BE
      *C             STOREROOM ITEMS.
      *C       - IF A PO IS NOT NON-PAYABLE (NON-CONSIGNED), THEN
      *C             DIRECT DELIVERY AND STOREROOM ITEMS CAN BE ON
      *C             THE SAME PO.
      *C
      *C   04/02/1998  CA YODER
      *C     ADDED LOGIC TO ALLOW A CONSIGNED ITEM TO BE FOR A
      *C     NON-STOREROOM DEPARTMENT IF IT'S A "000" PO.  OTHERWISE,
      *C     CONSIGNED ITEMS MUST BE ON A REQUIREMENT ORDER.
      *C
      *C   04/08/1998  CA YODER
      *C     ADDED LOGIC TO ALLOW A CONSIGNED ITEM TO BE FOR THE
      *C     STOREROOM DEPARTMENT ON A Z-BILL PO.
      *C
      *C   04/14/1998  CA YODER
      *C     ADDED LOGIC TO ALLOW A CONSIGNED ITEM TO BE FOR THE
      *C     STOREROOM DEPARTMENT ON A REGULAR "000" PO.
      *C
      *C   05/27/98  CA YODER
      *C     ADDED CALL TO "SCALCBGT" TO CALCULATE THE CORRECT
      *C     BUDGET AMOUNT FOR THE PO.  REMOVED LOGIC THAT USED
      *C     TO DO THE CALCULATION IN THIS PROGRAM.
      *C
      *C   10/05/98  CA YODER
      *C     ADDED LOGIC FOR VALLEYFIELD TO OBTAIN THE DEPARTMENT
      *C     AND EXPENSE CLASS FROM MSTORERM INSTEAD OF FROM THE
      *C     LAST PO.
      *C
      *C   06/07/99   CA YODER   (DECATUR REQUEST)
      *C     RE-COMPILED TO PICK UP MTAX DATABASE CHANGE TO
      *C     EXPAND TAX RATE PERCENTAGE FROM 2 DECIMAL PLACES TO 4.
      *C
      *C   09/08/99  CA YODER    NAPANEE REQUEST
      *C     MOVE MSTORERM MARKET COST TO UNIT VALUE FIELD FOR
      *C     REPAIR PURCHASE ORDER ITEMS.
      *C
      *C   03/01/00  CA YODER    NAPANEE REQUEST    (D. STUBBS)
      *C     REMOVE LOGIC TO UPDATE MARKET COST ON REPAIR ORDERS.
      *C
      *C   03/27/00  CA YODER    NAPANEE REQUEST
      *C     DISPLAY WARNING MESSAGE WHEN EXPENSE CLASS ON PO ITEM
      *C     (FROM MSTORERM) DIFFERS FROM EXPENSE CLASS ON REQUISITION.
      *C
      *C   06/12/02  CA YODER    LAWTON REQUEST
      *C     DISPLAY WARNING MESSAGE WHEN PO ITEM AMOUNT EXCEEDS REQ
      *C     BUDGET AMOUNT BY PERCENTAGE SPECIFIED IN MPLTINFO
      *C     (NON-CODED M-REQS ONLY).
      *C

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SPECIAL-NAMES. I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT TAXGST-FILE        ASSIGN TO DISK-TAXGST
                                     FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

