       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77  CODE-DUP-SW                  PIC X.
       77  SAVE-CHAT-SW                 PIC X.
       77  SAVE-PACD-SW                 PIC X.
       77  SAVE-PCPO-SW                 PIC X.
