       77  REQ-COMPARE-PERCENT          PIC S9V99   VALUE 0.
       77  K-PO-ITEM-EXT                PIC S9(11)V9(2).

       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1            PIC X  VALUE "0".
           05  FILE-STATUS-2            PIC X  VALUE "0".

       01  SAVE-CONSIGN-PO-TYPE          PIC X.
           88  CONSIGNED-PO                    VALUE "C".
           88  NON-CONSIGNED-PO                VALUE "N".


