      *
      ***********************************

       01  PO-DESC-PARMS.
           05  PODESC-COMPANY-SAVE       PIC X(3)   VALUE SPACES.
           05  SAVE-MANUFACTUR-DESC      PIC X(26)  VALUE SPACES.

