                                            DE2-COMPANY-L
           MOVE DE2-EDIPOLIT             TO DE2-EDIPOLIT-L
           MOVE DE2-PO                   TO DE2-PO-L
           MOVE DE2-PO-REL               TO DE2-PO-REL-L
           MOVE DE2-ITEM-NO              TO DE2-ITEM-NO-L
           MOVE DE2-REQ-NO               TO DE2-REQ-NO-L
