           MOVE DE2-PRICE-UM             TO DE2-PRICE-UM-L
           MOVE DE2-CODE                 TO DE2-CODE-L
           MOVE DE2-QTY                  TO DE2-QTY-L
           MOVE DE2-QTY-UM               TO DE2-QTY-UM-L
           MOVE DE2-SUB-DETL             TO DE2-SUB-DETL-L
