           MOVE DE2-MANUFACTUR-LIT       TO DE2-MANUFACTUR-LIT-L
           MOVE DE2-STD-INST-TABLE       TO DE2-STD-INST-TABLE-L
           MOVE DE2-RCV-INST-TABLE       TO DE2-RCV-INST-TABLE-L
           MOVE DE2-MANUFACTUR-SELECT
                                         TO DE2-MANUFACTUR-SELECT-L
